#### [NEW] [`backend/src/models/BlockchainRecord.js`](file:///c:/Users/ritik/OneDrive/Desktop/PehchaanAI/backend/src/models/BlockchainRecord.js)
- Mongoose schema for persistent blockchain verification records in MongoDB:
  - `caseId`: String (references Case ID)
  - `documentId`: String (indexed)
  - `documentType`: String (Aadhaar, Passport, Visa, etc.)
